WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.466
Welcome to SaloneHCM employee self-service training.

2
00:00:03.466 --> 00:00:14.722
This short session shows you everything you can do yourself — see your payslips, request leave, record attendance, and check your details — without waiting in line at the H R office.

3
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.649
Sign in with the work email and password H R gave you.

4
00:00:18.649 --> 00:00:23.181
If you forget your password, your administrator can reset it in seconds.

5
00:00:23.181 --> 00:00:25.762
Let's sign in as Joseph, a civil servant.

6
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.415
The self-service page is your home.

7
00:00:29.415 --> 00:00:34.427
Your payslips are listed with gross pay, deductions, and net pay for every month.

8
00:00:34.427 --> 00:00:45.130
Open any one to see the full breakdown — your P A Y E tax, your NASSIT contribution, any loan repayment — and download the P D F for your records or a bank loan application.

9
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:51.981
Need time off? Go to leave, press new request, choose your dates and leave type, and submit.

10
00:00:51.981 --> 00:00:58.833
Your manager is notified immediately, and you can watch the status change from pending to approved right here.

11
00:00:58.833 --> 00:01:03.194
Your remaining balance always shows, so there's never a guessing game.

12
00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:09.748
On the attendance page you clock in and out, and review your own history.

13
00:01:09.748 --> 00:01:18.066
If something looks wrong — a missed clock-out, for example — tell your H R officer and they can correct it, with the correction logged.

14
00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:23.350
That's it — payslips, leave, and attendance, all in your own hands.

15
00:01:23.350 --> 00:01:29.714
If you're unsure about anything, the Training Center has a quick reference card made just for employees.

16
00:01:29.714 --> 00:01:30.938
Thanks for watching.
